I don't want practicality.
我不想谈什么务实。

1264
00:58:34.770 --> 00:58:38.470
I want to play pranks with Pam, but I can't because she keeps breaking my heart.
我想和帕姆一起搞恶作剧，但我做不到，因为她总是让我心碎。

1265
00:58:38.990 --> 00:58:39.350
Yes.
没错。

1266
00:58:39.690 --> 00:58:44.190
Well, finally, Michael does pick up the phone, right?
好吧，最后迈克尔终于接电话了，对吧？

1267
00:58:44.490 --> 00:58:48.190
He's like, I'm going to call Jan and I'm going to ask for a raise.
他说，我要给简打电话，我要申请加薪。

1268
00:58:48.350 --> 00:58:52.570
And he's got Jan on speakerphone and Daryl is supervising.
他开了免提，达里尔在旁边监督。

1269
00:58:52.710 --> 00:58:55.190
He's kind of like going to be his support, right?
他算是他的后盾，对吧？

1270
00:58:55.370 --> 00:58:55.830
His coach.
他的教练。

1271
00:58:55.950 --> 00:58:56.070
Yeah.
是啊。

1272
00:58:56.070 --> 00:59:02.270
And Jan tells Michael the only way they can discuss a possible raise is if he comes in
简告诉迈克尔，如果想讨论加薪的可能性，他必须在五点前亲自过来，

1273
00:59:02.270 --> 00:59:05.910
person by five o'clock and he has to bring Toby.
而且必须带上托比。

1274
00:59:06.670 --> 00:59:10.750
And he says, Toby is the worst human being I've ever known.
他说，托比是我见过最糟糕的人。

1275
00:59:11.010 --> 00:59:12.890
Michael says, I'm bringing Daryl.
迈克尔说，我要带达里尔去。

1276
00:59:13.010 --> 00:59:15.830
And she's like, Michael, we need someone from HR.
她说，迈克尔，我们需要人力资源部的人在场。

1277
00:59:16.110 --> 00:59:19.410
So now the three of them are going to be on this weird road trip.
所以现在他们三个人要踏上一段奇怪的公路旅行了。

1278
00:59:19.410 --> 00:59:23.630
In the meantime, Angela still wants to hear this story, guys.
与此同时，安吉拉还想听这个故事，伙计们。

1279
00:59:23.830 --> 00:59:24.690
