And then, but Michael's not invited.
但是迈克尔没被邀请。

1328
01:01:20.710 --> 01:01:21.410
I know.
我知道。

1329
01:01:22.210 --> 01:01:25.250
I love this odd grouping of people.
我喜欢这种奇怪的人员组合。

1330
01:01:25.570 --> 01:01:27.330
This is one of my favorite things.
这是我最喜欢的情节之一。

1331
01:01:27.490 --> 01:01:29.830
This feels very Mike Schur to me as well.
我觉得这很有迈克·舒尔（Mike Schur）的风格。

1332
01:01:30.010 --> 01:01:32.430
He loved to team up odd characters.
他很喜欢把性格迥异的角色凑在一起。

1333
01:01:32.430 --> 01:01:39.150
Angela, I have to say, they bring up the movie Rush Hour in the car, right?
安吉拉，我得说，他们在车里提到了电影《尖峰时刻》，对吧？

1334
01:01:39.430 --> 01:01:43.330
And this made me think of the movie Speed.
这让我想到了电影《生死时速》。

1335
01:01:44.010 --> 01:01:45.570
Stay with me here.
听我说完。

1336
01:01:45.930 --> 01:01:48.770
Do you remember a few podcasts back?
你还记得几期播客之前吗？

1337
01:01:48.770 --> 01:01:52.950
You were like, line for line, quoting Speed.
你当时一字不差地引用了《生死时速》里的台词。

1338
01:01:53.270 --> 01:01:55.890
And I was like, when is the last time you watched Speed?
我当时就问，你上次看《生死时速》是什么时候？

1339
01:01:56.130 --> 01:01:58.090
And you were like, three days ago.
你说，三天前。

1340
01:01:58.610 --> 01:01:59.590
Pop quiz, asshole.
突击测验，混蛋。

1341
01:02:00.010 --> 01:02:01.010
There it is.
