01:20:35.630 --> 01:20:39.770
So like, you know, he tries to give him a display case for his bobblehead.
比如，他试着送他一个展示柜来放他的摇头娃娃。

1724
01:20:39.770 --> 01:20:46.090
And he tries to give him this certificate of bravery from the Scranton Police Department.
他还试着送他一张斯克兰顿警察局颁发的勇敢证书。

1725
01:20:46.170 --> 01:20:48.870
But it's, you know, something they give to little kids.
但你知道，那是给小孩子发的。

1726
01:20:49.130 --> 01:20:50.770
Well, it has a teddy bear on it.
上面还有个泰迪熊。

1727
01:20:52.190 --> 01:20:53.670
And he just throws it away.
结果他直接把它扔了。

1728
01:20:53.670 --> 01:20:57.630
And Jim just can't figure out how he can repay Dwight.
吉姆就是想不出该怎么报答德怀特。

1729
01:20:58.930 --> 01:21:01.030
And well, then he finds a way.
不过后来，他找到了办法。

1730
01:21:02.210 --> 01:21:03.270
Yeah, he does.
没错，他找到了。

1731
01:21:03.810 --> 01:21:05.910
So, yeah, everyone's left.
所以，大家都走了。

1732
01:21:06.610 --> 01:21:08.070
Angela and Dwight think they're alone.
安吉拉和德怀特以为他们独处了。

1733
01:21:09.070 --> 01:21:12.070
Angela tells Dwight she's heard tales of bravery.
安吉拉告诉德怀特她听说了勇敢的事迹。

1734
01:21:13.250 --> 01:21:13.410
Yeah.
是啊。

1735
01:21:13.930 --> 01:21:15.010
A gallant hero.
一位英勇的英雄。

1736
01:21:15.290 --> 01:21:15.670
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1737
01:21:15.970 --> 01:21:19.950
And maybe they'll have to read the report.
也许他们以后得一起读那份报告。

1738
01:21:20.270 --> 01:21:22.090
Toby's report together later.
托比的报告。

1739
01:21:22.390 --> 01:21:22.650
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1740
01:21:22.750 --> 01:21:27.270
And Dwight just scoops her up and gives her a big old smooch.
然后德怀特一把抱起她，给了她一个大大的吻。

1741
01:21:28.230 --> 01:21:30.130
And who walks out of the bathroom?
这时谁从洗手间走出来了？

1742
01:21:31.590 --> 01:21:32.230
Jim.
吉姆。

1743
01:21:33.070 --> 01:21:34.390
He sees it all.
他全看见了。

1744
01:21:34.770 --> 01:21:36.910
And he's like, oh, my gosh.
他当时想，天哪。

1745
01:21:37.370 --> 01:21:39.290
His face is so brilliant.
他的表情真是太精彩了。

1746
01:21:39.810 --> 01:21:42.770
Now, there are two things that this scene made me think of.
现在，这个场景让我想到了两件事。

1747
01:21:43.490 --> 01:21:51.970
So, number one, I noticed that when Rain comes over to you, he sits on your desk.
第一，我注意到当雷恩走过来时，他坐在了你的桌子上。

1748
01:21:52.230 --> 01:21:52.810
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1749
01:21:52.810 --> 01:21:57.470
Was that intentional so you guys would be kind of the same height to start kissing?
那是故意的吗？为了让你们开始接吻时身高差不多？

1750
01:21:58.530 --> 01:21:59.170
Always.
一直都是。

1751
01:22:00.090 --> 01:22:00.730
Always.
一直都是。

1752
01:22:01.250 --> 01:22:06.090
And almost every scene Dwight and Angela have together, he is seated.
而且德怀特和安吉拉在一起的几乎每一场戏，他都是坐着的。

1753
01:22:07.610 --> 01:22:08.890
Look it up, guys.
你们去查查就知道了。

1754
01:22:09.190 --> 01:22:10.930
I totally noticed it.
我完全注意到了。

1755
01:22:11.310 --> 01:22:12.910
He is, what, six foot three?
他大概有一米九吧？

1756
01:22:13.150 --> 01:22:13.990
I am five one.
我才一米五五。

1757
01:22:13.990 --> 01:22:19.430
And here's the other thing that this scene made me think of, which is that Jim has this
还有一件事让我想到了这个场景，就是吉姆有这么一个

1758
01:22:19.430 --> 01:22:24.670
talking head where he says, I will never say a word, and now we're even?
采访镜头，他说：“我绝不会说出去，现在我们扯平了？”

1759
01:22:25.730 --> 01:22:32.630
So, this means that Pam never told Jim what she knows about Dwight and Angela's relationship.
所以，这意味着帕姆从来没告诉过吉姆她知道德怀特和安吉拉的关系。

1760
01:22:32.950 --> 01:22:33.870
That's right.
没错。

1761
01:22:34.530 --> 01:22:36.810
Pam completely kept that a secret.
帕姆完全保守了这个秘密。

1762
01:22:37.610 --> 01:22:37.970
Yeah.
是啊。

1763
01:22:38.510 --> 01:22:40.710
Pam, I mean, I will say this.
帕姆，我是说，我想说的是。

1764
01:22:40.830 --> 01:22:42.910
Pam does right by Angela over and over.
帕姆一次又一次地为安吉拉着想。

1765
01:22:42.910 --> 01:22:43.650
She does.
确实。

1766
01:22:44.270 --> 01:22:49.190
I was like, I guess I had forgotten that Pam never told Jim.
我当时想，我大概是忘了帕姆从来没告诉过吉姆。

1767
01:22:49.910 --> 01:22:53.470
Well, I have a little behind-the-scenes story about this scene.
嗯，关于这场戏我有个幕后小故事。

1768
01:22:53.970 --> 01:23:02.290
We did probably like three or four takes just to get the timing right of Jim walking out and reacting.
我们大概拍了三四次，才把吉姆走出来并做出反应的时机把握好。

1769
01:23:02.730 --> 01:23:11.890
In one take, Rain sort of does this huge, grand gesture where he shoves everything off Oscar's desk.
有一次拍摄时，雷恩做了一个非常夸张的大动作，他把奥斯卡桌子上的所有东西都推开了。

1770
01:23:11.890 --> 01:23:16.110
You know, he like takes his hand and sweeps across the desk and everything goes flying.
你知道，他用手一扫，桌上的东西全飞了。

1771
01:23:16.110 --> 01:23:20.930
And he, and I'm like, ah, and he picks me up and lays me down on the desk.
然后，我当时想，啊，接着他把我抱起来放到了桌子上。

1772
01:23:21.170 --> 01:23:23.470
And we thought it was hilarious.
我们当时觉得这太搞笑了。

1773
01:23:23.470 --> 01:23:26.530
And Jeff Blitz was like, it's probably too much.
但杰夫·布里茨说：“这可能有点过头了。”

1774
01:23:29.110 --> 01:23:32.330
But that kind of goes with your whole like grape eating.
但这和你那种吃葡萄的方式挺像的。

1775
01:23:32.330 --> 01:23:33.710
I know.
我知道。

1776
01:23:34.030 --> 01:23:36.470
A whole like renaissance passion.
一种文艺复兴式的激情。

1777
01:23:36.850 --> 01:23:37.690
I know.
我知道。

1778
01:23:37.870 --> 01:23:38.810
Ooh, look at my ankle.
噢，看看我的脚踝。

1779
01:23:38.970 --> 01:23:39.310
Ooh.
噢。

1780
01:23:39.690 --> 01:23:40.030
Yeah.
是啊。

1781
01:23:41.090 --> 01:23:41.830
I know.
我知道。

1782
01:23:41.870 --> 01:23:43.230
But that cracked me up.
但那真的把我逗乐了。

1783
01:23:43.350 --> 01:23:45.510
But yeah, that is not the take we went with.
不过，那确实不是我们最终选用的版本。

1784
01:23:45.790 --> 01:23:49.790
And then before the show ends, Andy returns, guys.
然后在剧集结束前，安迪回来了，伙计们。

1785
01:23:50.010 --> 01:23:52.230
He is back from anger management.
他从愤怒管理培训回来了。

1786
01:23:52.230 --> 01:23:54.490
He's not going to blow his second chance.
他不会浪费这次重来的机会。

1787
01:23:54.690 --> 01:23:54.890
Yes.
没错。

1788
01:23:54.890 --> 01:23:59.650
He walks in the office and immediately gets pepper sprayed by Dwight.
他走进办公室，立刻就被德怀特喷了防狼喷雾。

1789
01:23:59.950 --> 01:24:00.150
Yes.
是的。

1790
01:24:00.650 --> 01:24:06.470
This leads to Toby taking away all of Dwight's weapons underneath his desk.
这导致托比收走了德怀特桌子底下所有的武器。

1791
01:24:06.650 --> 01:24:09.810
He had a little Sharpie star thing.
他有一个像记号笔做的飞镖之类的东西。

1792
01:24:09.990 --> 01:24:10.490
What do they call it?
那叫什么来着？

1793
01:24:10.570 --> 01:24:11.290
You throw the star at people?
就是那种朝人扔的飞镖？

1794
01:24:11.290 --> 01:24:11.550
A throwing star?
手里剑？

1795
01:24:12.390 --> 01:24:13.690
Or Sharpie star.
或者是记号笔飞镖。

1796
01:24:13.690 --> 01:24:20.290
And he had nunchucks and pepper spray all duct taped under his desk.
他桌子底下还用胶带粘着双节棍和防狼喷雾。

1797
01:24:20.590 --> 01:24:20.710
Yeah.
是啊。

1798
01:24:20.970 --> 01:24:24.230
I think maybe Toby's next stop should be Creed's drawer.
我觉得托比下一个该去查查克里德的抽屉。

1799
01:24:24.850 --> 01:24:34.230
Because remember when Creed was able to whittle the wooden stake, he opened his drawer and he had like a lot of stuff in there.
因为还记得克里德能削木桩的时候吗？他打开抽屉，里面装了好多东西。

1800
01:24:34.230 --> 01:24:44.930
I feel like there's a world where Creed hits a button and his desk flips up and there's stairs that go below the office into an underground bunker.
我觉得在某个世界里，克里德按下一个按钮，他的桌子就会翻开，下面有通往办公室地下的楼梯，直达一个地下掩体。

1801
01:24:45.230 --> 01:24:49.090
And he has everything you need for any doomsday scenario.
而且他拥有你应对任何末日场景所需的一切。

1802
01:24:50.310 --> 01:24:55.490
Well, Dwight ends this with a talking head saying he's not a hero, just a defender of the office.
嗯，德怀特在结尾的采访中说他不是英雄，只是办公室的守护者。

1803
01:24:55.730 --> 01:25:01.370
A real hero is hero from Heroes, which was an NBC show on at the time.
真正的英雄是《英雄》里的英雄，那是当时NBC的一档节目。

1804
01:25:01.630 --> 01:25:02.630
Huge, huge show.
非常、非常火的节目。

1805
01:25:02.830 --> 01:25:03.870
Huge, huge show.
非常、非常火的节目。

1806
01:25:03.870 --> 01:25:06.110
Remember, what was their big catchphrase?
记得吗，他们那句著名的口号是什么？

1807
01:25:06.230 --> 01:25:07.230
Protect the cheerleader?
保护啦啦队长？

1808
01:25:07.850 --> 01:25:08.910
I don't remember.
我不记得了。

1809
01:25:09.610 --> 01:25:10.610
Yeah, that sounds right.
对，听起来没错。

1810
01:25:11.050 --> 01:25:13.730
Save the cheerleader, Sam says.
山姆说是拯救啦啦队长。

1811
01:25:14.250 --> 01:25:15.550
Save the cheerleader.
拯救啦啦队长。

1812
01:25:16.310 --> 01:25:17.910
Turns out cheerleader didn't need saving.
结果啦啦队长根本不需要拯救。

1813
01:25:18.110 --> 01:25:18.910
She had superpowers.
她有超能力。

1814
01:25:21.310 --> 01:25:28.210
Before we say goodbye to the negotiation, Jenna, there's something really important we missed we did not talk about.
在我们告别《谈判》这一集之前，珍娜，有一件非常重要的事情我们漏掉了，没谈到。

1815
01:25:28.730 --> 01:25:29.990
In the negotiation?
在《谈判》那一集里？

1816
01:25:30.590 --> 01:25:31.190
Yeah.
对。

1817
01:25:31.730 --> 01:25:32.070
What?
什么？

1818
01:25:32.730 --> 01:25:32.810
What?
什么？

1819
01:25:33.870 --> 01:25:36.970
We find out Ryan's middle name.
我们知道了瑞安的中间名。

1820
01:25:37.390 --> 01:25:38.070
Yes.
是的。

1821
01:25:38.830 --> 01:25:41.010
Ryan Bailey Howard.
瑞安·贝利·霍华德。

1822
01:25:41.370 --> 01:25:41.850
Yeah.
没错。

1823
01:25:42.070 --> 01:25:48.230
We also find out that Kelly wants to name their child, Usher Jennifer Hudson Kapoor.
我们还发现凯莉想给他们的孩子取名叫亚瑟·詹妮弗·哈德森·卡普尔。

1824
01:25:48.230 --> 01:25:51.530
Well, that's it for the negotiation, you guys.
好了，关于《谈判》这一集就聊到这儿了，各位。

1825
01:25:51.530 --> 01:25:55.390
Guys, thank you so much for sending in your questions and to David Denman.
伙计们，非常感谢你们发来的问题，也感谢大卫·丹曼。

1826
01:25:55.390 --> 01:25:58.430
Yes, David, thank you so much.
是的，大卫，非常感谢你。

1827
01:25:59.650 --> 01:26:03.770
Guys, we are getting close to wrapping up season three here.
各位，我们快要结束第三季的节目了。

1828
01:26:03.970 --> 01:26:07.910
We're in the final stretch of episodes and they are all going to get good.
我们正处于最后几集的冲刺阶段，每一集都会很精彩。

1829
01:26:07.910 --> 01:26:09.430
Real good.
非常精彩。

1830
01:26:09.830 --> 01:26:11.230
We'll see you next time.
我们下期见。

